@archive 0006
@size 3

script 0 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = SoniaBeach
	"야호!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"스바루, 루나, 곤타,\n키자마로!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"정말 믿을 수가 없어!!\n여기서 너희를\n다 만나게 될 줄이야!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"너희는 여기서\n뭐 하고 있어!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoBeach
	"학교 여행 왔어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"너는?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = SoniaBeach
	"다음 앨범 재킷 사진을\n촬영하러 왔어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"앨범에 열대 지방의 느낌을\n담고 싶어서 오늘 여기서\n사진을 찍고 있었지."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = BudBeach
	"미-미소라…!\nTV 방송 녹화 때도\n정말 멋졌는데…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = ZackBeach
	"수영복도 정말 잘\n어울려!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = SoniaBeach
	"후후, 고마워!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"하지만 지금은 조금\n부끄럽네."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = LunaBeach
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"(으윽! 유명인은 역시…!)"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"(나 같은 애는 저런 애들과\n 경쟁할 수 없어!)"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Vogue
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"(걱정 마, 루나! 너도\n 미소라 못지않게 멋져!)"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = SoniaBeach
	"그런데…\n이 해변은 촬영을 위해\n예약해 둔 곳이었거든…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"…아무래도 예약 시간이\n이미 지난 모양이야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"어떻게 하지…?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"매니저에게 문제가 좀\n생겼다고 말해야 할\n것 같아…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoBeach
	"문제?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = SoniaBeach
	"응…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"사실 여기에 세워\n둔 돌담의 일부가\n리얼 웨이브야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 1 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoBeach
	"흠…\n리얼 웨이브라고?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 2 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = SoniaBeach
	"응, 그리고…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"사진을 몇 장 더 찍으려고 그 돌담을\n히비스커스를 심은 꽃밭으로"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"바꿀 예정이었어. 사진을 몇 장 더\n찍을 수 있도록 말이야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그런데 안에 바이러스가\n있는 것\n같아서 바꾸지 못했어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그러자 엄청 큰 위저드가\n나타나서 자기에게\n맡기라고 했지."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그리고 사이버 코어 안으로\n들어갔어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoBeach
	"그럼 그 위저드는 어떻게\n됐어?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = SoniaBeach
	"아직도 돌아오지 않았어…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"들어간 지 꽤\n오래됐는데…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"이봐, 꼬맹아…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoBeach
	"응…\n그 위저드에게 무슨 일이\n생긴 걸까…?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"전파 변환해서\n확인해 보자."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
